### 入职档案管理API测试脚本
### 基础URL: http://localhost:8080

### 1. 获取职位级别列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/position-levels
Accept: application/json

### 2. 获取档案状态列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/statuses
Accept: application/json

### 3. 创建入职档案
POST http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateName": "张三",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "position": "软件工程师",
  "positionLevel": "STAFF",
  "departmentId": "1",
  "departmentName": "技术部",
  "expectedSalary": 15000.00,
  "finalSalary": 18000.00,
  "onboardDate": "2026-02-15"
}

### 4. 分页查询档案列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/list?page=1&size=10
Accept: application/json

### 5. 根据状态查询档案（待HR审查）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/by-status/PENDING_HR
Accept: application/json

### 6. 获取待HR审查的档案列表
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/pending-hr
Accept: application/json

### 7. 获取档案详情（需要将{id}替换为实际的档案ID）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/1
Accept: application/json

### 8. 更新档案（需要将{id}替换为实际的档案ID）
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidateName": "张三",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "phone": "13800138001",
  "position": "高级软件工程师",
  "positionLevel": "STAFF",
  "departmentId": "1",
  "departmentName": "技术部",
  "expectedSalary": 15000.00,
  "finalSalary": 20000.00,
  "onboardDate": "2026-02-20"
}

### 9. 提交档案审批（需要将{id}替换为实际的档案ID）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/1/submit
Accept: application/json

### 10. 删除档案（需要将{id}替换为实际的档案ID）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/onboarding/archive/1
Accept: application/json
